# Phase-memory commit surface.
#
# This copied project contains large third-party/runtime folders from the
# original X-ICM checkout. Keep the commit focused on the phase-memory pipeline
# source, review utilities, and docs.

*

# Project-level source and docs.
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/PHASE_MEMORY_PIPELINE.md
!/PHASE_ANCHOR_PIPELINE.md
!/LICENSE
!/config.yaml
!/main.py
!/crosstask_icl_agent.py
!/form_icl_demonstrations_crosstask_ranking.py
!/phase_interpreter.py
!/utils.py

# Phase interpreter -> anchor compiler -> memory controller code.
!/phase_anchor_pipeline/
!/phase_anchor_pipeline/*.py
!/phase_memory_pipeline/
!/phase_memory_pipeline/*.py

# Current review/benchmark scripts only.
!/scripts/
/scripts/*
!/scripts/collect_phase_memory_runtime_review.py
!/scripts/generate_phase_anchor_pipeline_review.py
!/scripts/generate_phase_benchmark_review.py
!/scripts/generate_phase_interpreter_review.py
!/scripts/generate_phase_memory_packet_review.py
!/scripts/generate_rerank_review_trace.py
!/scripts/launch_phase_memory_benchmark_5ep_from_local.sh
!/scripts/run_phase_memory_review_on_cair.sh
!/scripts/run_phase_memory_smoke_on_cair.sh

# Never commit generated or local runtime material if the allowlist changes.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.log
*.mp4
*.avi
*.mov
